    <sys:String x:Key="L_About">About</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L_About_details">Offline desktop tools for file conversion, English/French translation, ZIP archives and authenticated AES-256 encryption. Original files are retained. Layout preservation depends on the source document; scanned text needs OCR. Open History to find output paths and operation results. Includes LibreOffice, PyMuPDF, pdf2docx and Argos Translate; component licenses are supplied with the application.</sys:String>
