    <sys:String x:Key="L_About_features">Convert Word, Excel, PowerPoint, images and PDF documents. Translate English and French documents, merge PDFs, compress or extract ZIP archives, and protect files with password-based encryption.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L_About_privacy">Your documents are processed locally. Source files are retained, existing outputs are never overwritten, and History records completed operations and output locations. The translation engine runs automatically on this computer.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L_About_layout">Document formatting is preserved where the selected format supports it. PDF translation keeps page artwork and can add continuation pages when translated text does not fit; PDF-to-Word preserves page appearance as images, so page content is not directly editable. TXT contains text only. Scanned text requires OCR. Keep your encryption password: it is required to decrypt your files.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L_About_components">Built for Windows with C# and WPF. Document processing uses LibreOffice, PyMuPDF, pdf2docx and PdfPig; offline translation uses Argos Translate. Component notices and licenses are included in the installation.</sys:String>
